        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-ANNSIM-SIMAUD-PHASE3-STRATEGY.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-PHASE3-DOMAIN-AXIOMS.
            05  WS-LIVING-LAB-MENTIONS      PIC 9(04) VALUE 0046.
            05  WS-DIGITAL-TWIN-MENTIONS    PIC 9(04) VALUE 0015.
            05  WS-BIM-WORKFLOW-MENTIONS    PIC 9(04) VALUE 0010.
            05  WS-SENSOR-TELEMETRY-COUNT   PIC 9(04) VALUE 0011.
            05  WS-LEED-PLATINUM-COUNT      PIC 9(04) VALUE 0003.
            05  WS-HONEYWELL-BAS-COUNT      PIC 9(04) VALUE 0014.
            05  WS-PHASE3-PROOF-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-DOMAIN-AXIOMS.
            GOBACK.
        1000-VERIFY-DOMAIN-AXIOMS.
            IF WS-LIVING-LAB-MENTIONS >= 10 AND
               WS-DIGITAL-TWIN-MENTIONS >= 10 AND
               WS-BIM-WORKFLOW-MENTIONS >= 5 AND
               WS-SENSOR-TELEMETRY-COUNT >= 5 AND
               WS-HONEYWELL-BAS-COUNT >= 5
                MOVE 1 TO WS-PHASE3-PROOF-CODE
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-PHASE3-PROOF-CODE.
